{"data": [{"author_id": "215895007", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:00:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115186992791052419"], "id": "2115186992791052419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/5 TSMC is reportedly raising CoWoS prices up to 20 percent. The box the chip sits in is now the bottleneck. https://t.co/3IxBetBkmB", "url": "https://x.com/juzzzzzzzzzzy/status/2115186992791052419"}, {"author_id": "1935305940779012096", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:15:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115190786866192514"], "id": "2115190786866192514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC considers a 20% increase in CoWoS costs as Blackwell and Rubin pressure packaging capacity https://t.co/QYcEIcWppG", "url": "https://x.com/Iaexpertos80443/status/2115190786866192514"}, {"author_id": "1935305940779012096", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:15:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115190725038031027"], "id": "2115190725038031027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC valora un incremento del 20% en los costes de CoWoS mientras Blackwell y Rubin presionan la capacidad de empaquetado https://t.co/vaHSxlvOh4", "url": "https://x.com/Iaexpertos80443/status/2115190725038031027"}, {"author_id": "1874887449404448769", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:04:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115187783065092349"], "id": "2115187783065092349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1327, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$KLAC将在10月28日盘后公布财报。上一季度营收达到36.58亿美元，管理层预计本季度进一步增长至40亿美元左右。但就在半导体设备需求持续增长的同时，$LRCX、$AMAT和$KLAC却在10月遭遇集中抛售。$MU $TSM $ASML\n\n这轮调整最值得研究的地方，是半导体设备公司的基本面并没有同步出现明显恶化。", "url": "https://x.com/youngstockuser/status/2115187783065092349"}, {"author_id": "875324074620207104", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:30:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115194423592341661"], "id": "2115194423592341661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 362, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【 $AMKR / Amkor Technology 2026 Q3】\n\n🔵 売上 $1,991M（前年比+0.2%・前四半期比+4.9%）。予想$2.03Bを約2%下回る\n🔵 EPS $0.76（前年$0.51・+49%）。予想$0.77〜0.78に僅かに届かず\n🔵 粗利率18.3%（前年14.3%）、営業利益率11.3%（前年8.0%）\n🔵 株価は10/26終値$36.81 → https://t.co/Mxr3CY8URV", "url": "https://x.com/semordnilap0704/status/2115194423592341661"}, {"author_id": "215895007", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:05:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115188037428625644"], "id": "2115188037428625644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2/5 CoWoS is the packaging that glues a GPU to its high-bandwidth memory in one unit. Demand has spread past GPUs to server CPUs and custom AI chips, and the lines are booked out anyway.", "url": "https://x.com/juzzzzzzzzzzy/status/2115188037428625644"}, {"author_id": "215895007", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:20:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115191817268240788"], "id": "2115191817268240788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "5/5 Prediction: packaging slots, not wafer starts, will decide who ships AI hardware on time in 2027. Prepay for CoWoS or get in line.", "url": "https://x.com/juzzzzzzzzzzy/status/2115191817268240788"}, {"author_id": "1988572593557999616", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:34:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115195394875646084"], "id": "2115195394875646084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5485, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$STX reported great numbers, but is down after-hours.\n\nPerhaps we're seeing a negative re-rating in HDD, closer to the forward multiples of memory stocks? If one calls memory a cyclical commodity with boom/bust periods, what is HDD then? \n\nOn top of that, for the Memory Big 3,", "url": "https://x.com/EhrmantrautCap_/status/2115195394875646084"}, {"author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:15:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115190760681136219"], "id": "2115190760681136219", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "오늘 아침 반도체 뉴스를 보다 보니 HBM 쪽 이야기가 계속 나오고 있더라.\n\n번스타인이 10월 22일 추정한 3분기 HBM 매출은 삼성 87억 달러, SK하이닉스 76억 달러였어.\n\n카운터포인트 2분기 점유율은 SK 50%, 삼성 33%로 격차가 좁아진 상태고.\n\n삼성 잠정 실적은 영업이익 107조 4000억 원이었고 https://t.co/HlgDafOwEE", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2115190760681136219"}, {"author_id": "1942391883537461248", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:26:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115193464891801931"], "id": "2115193464891801931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 692, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$Uctt Hearing from customers 2028 more or less booked. Who are their top customers?\n$ASML $LRCX $KLAC $AMAT Tokyo Electron and some times Intc and TSM", "url": "https://x.com/R_and_Invest/status/2115193464891801931"}, {"author_id": "129365571", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:12:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115189958503973112"], "id": "2115189958503973112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 115, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"TSMC、熊本で国内初の3ナノ量産へ 2028年12月開始、投資額157億ドル超\" https://t.co/mFXKlUuj7E", "url": "https://x.com/akiboaks/status/2115189958503973112"}, {"author_id": "2058373235859968000", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:31:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115194700638654550"], "id": "2115194700638654550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 984, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "🚀 10 AI Stocks on My Radar Right Now\nAI is more than just a trend. The companies building the chips, memory, and infrastructure behind it could play a major role in the next phase of growth. 📈\n👀 Here are 10 names worth watching:\n\n1. $NVDA — NVIDIA\n2. $AVGO — Broadcom\n3. $MU — https://t.co/jPaHJvLB1t", "url": "https://x.com/nic11_olesmit/status/2115194700638654550"}, {"author_id": "2100170909986500608", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:00:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115186904320626701"], "id": "2115186904320626701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SpaceX and Tesla commit $16.8B to build TeraFab in Texas. The planned 100M-sq-ft mega-fab will unite fabrication, packaging, and testing to produce custom AI silicon for Optimus robots and orbital data centers. Can Musk break free from TSMC? #AI #TechNews https://t.co/gtkuHq2MOH", "url": "https://x.com/aifrontierpress/status/2115186904320626701"}, {"author_id": "625491197", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:01:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115187267010773166"], "id": "2115187267010773166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dutch IT Channel - ING: Dankzij ASML groeit Nederland tegen de Europese techtrend in https://t.co/Fhvy83YcjT", "url": "https://x.com/Dutchitchannel/status/2115187267010773166"}, {"author_id": "1444617678644076546", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:04:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115187872496292222"], "id": "2115187872496292222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ていうかAI銘柄さん、決算が罰ゲームじゃん。TERもSTXも下がるし。下がってないAI銘柄決算あったっけ？？\nWDC,BE,ASML,LRCX,TSM,TER,STX", "url": "https://x.com/fdaewfwe/status/2115187872496292222"}, {"author_id": "31425124", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:30:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115194551820546147"], "id": "2115194551820546147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2197, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115179183626412223", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Good reporting by @StephenNellis confirming Bluechip will source US-made @Qualcomm @Snapdragon X chips at TSMC Arizona fab!!\n\nhttps://t.co/Hp0dfI5reG https://t.co/mUS0hFa7kd", "url": "https://x.com/neil_shah/status/2115194551820546147"}, {"author_id": "2797194138", "created_at": "2026-10-27T20:55:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115185594481709132"], "id": "2115185594481709132", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3096, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115120702387098069", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Qualcomm's @cristianoamon confirmed on a press conference call: These Snapdragon X chips will be made in Arizona by TSMC. Story below -\n\nhttps://t.co/lx4jXPUdz3 https://t.co/GpnGes6gK2", "url": "https://x.com/StephenNellis/status/2115185594481709132"}, {"author_id": "19206934", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:01:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115187218864075148"], "id": "2115187218864075148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dutch IT Channel - ING: Dankzij ASML groeit Nederland tegen de Europese techtrend in https://t.co/FX8YEZifcT", "url": "https://x.com/WitoldKepinski/status/2115187218864075148"}, {"author_id": "1954025936992841731", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:00:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115186985014878423"], "id": "2115186985014878423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta raised $97.5B in equity, Nvidia and AMD committed $4B as cornerstone investors, Broadcom lined up $63B in financing for Anthropic, and TSMC is raising chip packaging prices 20%.\n\nThe AI buildout is now so large the companies funding it are buying stakes in each other.", "url": "https://x.com/LoomFinance/status/2115186985014878423"}, {"author_id": "1358751722886164486", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:29:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115194209288458527"], "id": "2115194209288458527", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Iran War: Is There a Bigger Game Behind It?\n\nMost people believe the US-Iran conflict is primarily about Iran’s alleged nuclear ambitions. But what if there’s a much bigger geopolitical strategy at play?\n\n🇨🇳 The real target could be China.\n\nChina has ambitions regarding", "url": "https://x.com/fkuall___/status/2115194209288458527"}, {"author_id": "2045267415177601024", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:11:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115189688382480522"], "id": "2115189688382480522", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1520, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115024490769862977", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$319 billion in semiconductor investment in Arizona since 2020.\n\nA $7 billion development going up next to TSMC.\n\nAnother $7.8 billion in Phoenix-area data center investment, representing nearly 40% of all commercial real estate investment sales through August.\n\nThese investments https://t.co/zTkGlKiI8G", "url": "https://x.com/project48az/status/2115189688382480522"}, {"author_id": "2050158903305076736", "created_at": "2026-10-27